gantt
    title Quest to Destroy the One Ring
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %d
    tickInterval 1month

    section Fellowship
    Fellowship of the Ring   :summary, fs, 2026-01-01, 2026-03-15
    Council of Elrond        :done, council, 2026-01-01, 7d
    Form the Fellowship      :active, form, after council, 10d
    Depart from Rivendell    :milestone, depart, after form, 0d

    section March to Mordor
    Pass of Caradhras        :crit, caradhras, after depart, 12d
    Mines of Moria           :crit, moria, after caradhras, 14d
    Lothlorien respite       :lorien, after moria, 10d

    section Carry the Ring (one line)
    Amon Hen   :r1, after lorien, 8d
    &Emyn Muil :r2, 2026-03-10, 8d
    &Marshes   :r3, 2026-03-18, 8d
    &Black Gate :r4, 2026-03-26, 8d

    section Mount Doom
    Climb Mount Doom         :climb, 2026-04-03, 9d
    Destroy the One Ring     :milestone, crit, destroy, after climb, 0d
    Fall of Barad-dur        :fall, after destroy, 3d

    link council FS form
    link form FS depart
    link depart FS caradhras
    link caradhras FS moria
    link moria SS lorien
    link lorien FS r1
    link r4 FS climb
    link climb FS destroy
    link destroy FF fall
